  "entries": [
    {
      "Original": "    》 If multiple design sets have the same name, the first one will be changed.",
      "Context": "[Glamourer] CommandService.SetAutomation",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ IChatGui.Print",
      "Translated": "    》若多个设计集同名，仅更改第一个。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "    》 If the design set name is a valid natural number it will be used as a index. Design names that are such numbers can not be dealt with.",
      "Context": "[Glamourer] CommandService.SetAutomation",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ IChatGui.Print",
      "Translated": "    》若设计集名称是有效的自然数，则按序号处理，因此无法按名称指定此类设计集。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "    》 The name is case-insensitive.",
      "Context": "[Glamourer] CommandService.SetAutomation",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ IChatGui.Print",
      "Translated": "    》名称不区分大小写。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Could not copy state to clipboard: Failure to write to clipboard.",
      "Context": "[Glamourer] CommandService.CopyState",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ IChatGui.Print",
      "Translated": "无法复制外观状态：剪贴板写入失败。",
